On Tue, Jul 14, 2026 at 12:59:21PM +0100, Wei-Lin Chang wrote:
> +static bool valid_entry(unsigned long entry)
> +{
> +	WARN_ON(entry & VALID_ENTRY && entry & UNKNOWN_IPA);
